#: KPrConfig.cpp:482
#, fuzzy
msgid "Vertical grid size:"
msgstr "Vertikala transiro"

#: KPrConfig.cpp:483
msgid ""
"Set the space in millimeters between two vertical points on the grid. "
"Default is 5 millimeters."
